    "detailed_description": "You came to this new land in search of a better life, and in the process you find yourself becoming a Soulveyor. Build up your land from scratch and collect souls throughout the world in order to help you become the best duelist there is. As you become stronger, test your strength against the  various temples scattered throughout the world. What secrets lie within them? Show the world what it means to be a Soulveyor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build/Craft</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As you tend to your land you can grow crops, build machines to process your products, use advanced conduit systems to transport your items, energy, fluids, and gasses, and create even more items to help you along your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seal Souls</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There are souls scattered across the world. Discover them by doing various tasks such as mining, chopping trees, harvesting food, etc. and duel them in order to properly seal their soul.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Duel</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To complete a seal you must duel the soul by using your own deck of scrolls in order to help you! You\u2019ll be transported to a battlefield where your duel will commence! You can even fight alongside your soul-mate, resulting in a 2v2 duel!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play With Friends</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Have as many players join your world as you want. Each player that joins gets their own plot of land to work on! Or take your character over to their world and stay for a while!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every world is completely unique and randomly generated. Explore the secrets of your land, or go visit other worlds and bring back their goods to yours!",
    "about_the_game": "You came to this new land in search of a better life, and in the process you find yourself becoming a Soulveyor. Build up your land from scratch and collect souls throughout the world in order to help you become the best duelist there is. As you become stronger, test your strength against the  various temples scattered throughout the world. What secrets lie within them? Show the world what it means to be a Soulveyor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build/Craft</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b313d02d9e8d4d02c277bdaf5a60b308.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As you tend to your land you can grow crops, build machines to process your products, use advanced conduit systems to transport your items, energy, fluids, and gasses, and create even more items to help you along your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seal Souls</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/939b62416138dd57aa3661efd343ebbf.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There are souls scattered across the world. Discover them by doing various tasks such as mining, chopping trees, harvesting food, etc. and duel them in order to properly seal their soul.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Duel</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/1f8f94748c5c7a84df0e598115a2ce4e.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To complete a seal you must duel the soul by using your own deck of scrolls in order to help you! You\u2019ll be transported to a battlefield where your duel will commence! You can even fight alongside your soul-mate, resulting in a 2v2 duel!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play With Friends</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/dc28283ac543064317c70d82a9068047.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Have as many players join your world as you want. Each player that joins gets their own plot of land to work on! Or take your character over to their world and stay for a while!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.poster.avif?t=1699560978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.webm?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652560/extras/b7fa6eb7726174124e2830cc39ff6b5f.mp4?t=1699560978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Every world is completely unique and randomly generated. Explore the secrets of your land, or go visit other worlds and bring back their goods to yours!",
